msgid "Give Me Lyrics"
msgstr "ຂໍເນື້ອເພງໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍແນ່"

#: data/com.github.muriloventuroso.givemelyrics.appdata.xml.in:9
msgid "Lyrics for your songs"
msgstr "ເນື້ອເພງສຳລັບເພງຂອງທ່ານ"

#: data/com.github.muriloventuroso.givemelyrics.appdata.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"See the lyrics of the song that is playing, from any application. Sing along "
"with the option to sync lyrics."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງເນື້ອເພງທີ່ກຳລັງຫຼິ້ນຢູ່ ຈາກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃດກໍໄດ້. ຮ້ອງຕາມໄປດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກການຊິງຄ໌ເນື້ອເພງ."

#: data/com.github.muriloventuroso.givemelyrics.appdata.xml.in:14
msgid "Fix Translations"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການແປພາສາ"

#: data/com.github.muriloventuroso.givemelyrics.appdata.xml.in:19
